    {
      "id": "u5",
      "num": 5,
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Talking about the past",
      "goal": "Use the witnessed past (-di), talk about memories and place events in time.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "The witnessed past is formed with <b>-di / -dı / -du / -dü</b>, chosen according to the last vowel. After a voiceless consonant, d becomes t: <tur>git-ti-m</tur>."
        },
        {
          "t": "table",
          "caption": "The past of gelmek and gitmek",
          "head": [
            "Person",
            "gelmek (to come)",
            "gitmek (to go)"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "ben",
              "<tur>geldim</tur>",
              "<tur>gittim</tur>"
            ],
            [
              "sen",
              "<tur>geldin</tur>",
              "<tur>gittin</tur>"
            ],
            [
              "o",
              "<tur>geldi</tur>",
              "<tur>gitti</tur>"
            ],
            [
              "biz",
              "<tur>geldik</tur>",
              "<tur>gittik</tur>"
            ],
            [
              "siz",
              "<tur>geldiniz</tur>",
              "<tur>gittiniz</tur>"
            ],
            [
              "onlar",
