    {
      "id": "u6",
      "num": 6,
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Suggesting and ordering",
      "goal": "Make suggestions, offer help and order in a restaurant.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "The <b>voluntative</b> (optative) is used to make suggestions: <b>-eyim / -ayım</b> for «I», <b>-elim / -alım</b> for «we». It is also used to offer help: <tur>Yardım edeyim mi?</tur> (May I help?)."
        },
        {
          "t": "table",
          "caption": "Suggesting and offering",
          "head": [
            "Form",
            "Meaning"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<tur>Geleyim.</tur>",
              "I will come (gladly)."
            ],
            [
              "<tur>Gelelim.</tur>",
              "Let's come."
            ],
            [
              "<tur>Bir çay içelim.</tur>",
              "Let's have some tea."
            ],
            [
              "<tur>Yardım edeyim mi?</tur>",
              "May I help?"
            ],
            [
              "<tur>Ne yapayım?</tur>",
              "What should I do?"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "In a restaurant, a few phrases are enough: <tur>Bir çorba lütfen.</tur> (A soup, please.), <tur>Ne tavsiye edersiniz?</tur> (What do you recommend?), <tur>Hesap lütfen.</tur> (The bill, please.)."
        },
        {
          "t": "ex",
          "items": [
            {
              "tr": "Akşam yemeğe gidelim.",
              "fr": "Let's go out for dinner tonight."
            },
            {
              "tr": "Bir kahve istiyorum.",
              "fr": "I would like a coffee."
            },
            {
              "tr": "Bu yemek çok lezzetli.",
              "fr": "This dish is really delicious."
            },
            {
              "tr": "Hesap lütfen.",
              "fr": "The bill, please."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "note",
          "kind": "tip",
          "tag": "Quantities",
          "text": "<tur>biraz</tur> (a little), <tur>çok</tur> (a lot), <tur>az</tur> (little), <tur>birkaç</tur> (a few), <tur>her</tur> (every), <tur>bütün</tur> (all). Example: <tur>Biraz su lütfen.</tur>"
        },
